From da41926105fcfab8f5a564e7b8020daadd259fb3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: wall-vt <wall-vt@local>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 17:49:10 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] t3: pty child reset signals and mask

Reset child signal dispositions across `1..NSIG_LIMIT` (`65` on Linux/Android
including real-time signals `32..=64`, `32` on macOS/BSD) using async-signal-safe
`sigaction(2)` with `sa_sigaction = SIG_DFL`, `sa_flags = 0`, and an empty
`sa_mask`, then clear the process signal mask (`SIG_SETMASK`) in both `spawn`
and `holder` fork paths.

Includes `pty_child_gets_clean_default_signals_flags_and_empty_mask` in
`crates/g3d-hold/src/spawn.rs` and extends `crates/g3d-termd/tests/env.rs`
to test `SIGPIPE`, `SIGQUIT`, `SIGTSTP`, `SIGHUP`, and blocked signal masks.
